{"id":65229,"date":"2026-08-30T11:58:36","date_gmt":"2026-08-30T10:58:36","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=65229"},"modified":"2026-10-01T22:48:45","modified_gmt":"2026-10-01T21:48:45","slug":"trail-por-terras-do-botto","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-por-terras-do-botto\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail Por Terras do Botto 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail Por Terras do Botto 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail Por Terras do Botto 2026<\/strong> \u00e9 um evento de corrida de montanha e natureza organizado pelo <strong>CDRConcavadaRunning<\/strong>, com o apoio do <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Abrantes<\/strong> e da Uni\u00e3o de Freguesias de Alvega e Concavada. Tendo como ponto de partida e chegada o acolhedor Largo Ch\u00e3o da Eira na aldeia de Concavada, o evento presta homenagem \u00e0 heran\u00e7a liter\u00e1ria de Ant\u00f3nio Botto, convidando os participantes a desbravarem trilhos ribeirinhos, caminhos rurais e \u00e1reas florestais do M\u00e9dio Tejo.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O programa integra tr\u00eas desafios em ambiente natural: o competitivo <strong>Trail Longo de 26 km<\/strong> (com 600m D+), o veloz <strong>Mini Trail de 15 km<\/strong> (com 400m D+) e a participativa <strong>Caminhada de 12 km<\/strong> (com 180m D+). Os atletas t\u00eam acesso a abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, seguro desportivo, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial, dorsal personalizado com chip eletr\u00f3nico, medalha de finalista, balne\u00e1rios com duches quentes e a possibilidade de desfrutarem de um almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio no final da jornada desportiva.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">25 de Outubro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-s