ign: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase \u00danica:<\/strong> 18,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 18\/10)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Running<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Mini Trail 15 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 25 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00 \u2022 400m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase \u00danica:<\/strong> 16,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 18\/10)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 12 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 25 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:15 \u2022 180m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase \u00danica:<\/strong> 10,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 18\/10)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio do Trail Por Terras do Botto 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se na manh\u00e3 de domingo, 25 de outubro de 2026, em Concavada, concelho de Abrantes. O Trail Longo (26 km) parte \u00e0s 08:45, o Mini Trail (15 km) \u00e0s 09:00 e a Caminhada (12 km) \u00e0s 09:15.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde funcionam a concentra\u00e7\u00e3o, a partida e o secretariado?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O centro nevr\u00e1lgico do evento, incluindo secretariado para levantamento de dorsais, p\u00f3rtico de partida e meta, localiza-se no Largo Ch\u00e3o da Eira, em Concavada.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e o desn\u00edvel acumulado de cada prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento contempla o Trail Longo de 26 km (+600m D+), o Mini Trail de 15 km (+400m D+) e a Caminhada n\u00e3o competitiva de 12 km (+180m D+).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e prazos?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es encerram a 18 de outubro de 2026 na plataforma Lap2Go, com valor \u00fanico: 18,00 \u20ac para o Trail Longo, 16,00 \u20ac para o Mini Trail e 10,00 \u20ac para a Caminhada. O almo\u00e7o p\u00f3s-prova custa 3,50 \u20ac para atletas.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Que servi\u00e7os e apoios est\u00e3o inclu\u00eddos na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui seguro desportivo, dorsal personalizado com chip, t-shirt oficial, medalha finisher (para quem concluir), refor\u00e7os alimentares ao longo do percurso e balne\u00e1rios com banho quente.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail Por Terras do Botto 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-25\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Concavada, Abrantes\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Abrantes\", \"addressRegion\": \"Santar\u00e9m\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio do Trail Por Terras do Botto 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova realiza-se na manh\u00e3 de domingo, 25 de outubro de 2026, em Concavada, concelho de Abrantes. O Trail Longo (26 km) parte \u00e0s 08:45, o Mini Trail (15 km) \u00e0s 09:00 e a Caminhada (12 km) \u00e0s 09:15.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde funcionam a concentra\u00e7\u00e3o, a partida e o secretariado?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O centro nevr\u00e1lgico do evento, incluindo secretariado para levantamento de dorsais, p\u00f3rtico de partida e meta, localiza-se no Largo Ch\u00e3o da Eira, em Concavada.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e o desn\u00edvel acumulado de cada prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento contempla o Trail Longo de 26 km (+600m D+), o Mini Trail de 15 km (+400m D+) e a Caminhada n\u00e3o competitiva de 12 km (+180m D+).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e prazos?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es encerram a 18 de outubro de 2026 na plataforma Lap2Go, com valor \u00fanico: 18,00 \u20ac para o Trail Longo, 16,00 \u20ac para o Mini Trail e 10,00 \u20ac para a Caminhada. O almo\u00e7o p\u00f3s-prova custa 3,50 \u20ac para atletas.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Que servi\u00e7os e apoios est\u00e3o inclu\u00eddos na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui seguro desportivo, dorsal personalizado com chip, t-shirt oficial, medalha finisher (para quem concluir), refor\u00e7os alimentares ao longo do percurso e balne\u00e1rios com banho quente.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":68617,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[727,820,39],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-65229","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-concavada-abrantes","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_2-santarem"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/cartaz-trail-por-terras-do-botto.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self"